8
00:00:24,785 --> 00:00:27,915
(Sheldon:)...that includes a Nobel Prize
and cities named after me.

9
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:31,920
(Sheldon:)All four wisdom teeth fit comfortably
in my mouth without need of extraction...

10
00:00:32,084 --> 00:00:34,964
(Sheldon:)...and my bowel movements run
Iike a German train schedule.

11
00:00:37,422 --> 00:00:39,762
(Sheldon:)Am I okay?

12
00:00:40,759 --> 00:00:42,009
(Dale:)I'm okay too.

13
00:00:49,810 --> 00:00:53,060
(Raj:)Wild Bill Witchcock.

14
